<title>GREECE: Greek Endyssi in trading debut.</title>
<headline>Greek Endyssi in trading debut.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek textile firm Endyssi, a parallel market listing, made its trading debut on the Athens bourse on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The firm raised 450 million drachmas by issuing 600,000 common registered shares at 750 drachmas a share.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading at 750 drachmas around mid-session. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
